nodes.body:
Same ask as #51698 - could a maintainer add `ready` so CI can run? Both are blocked on that label, so they're convenient to do together.

Frontend-only, one parser file plus tests: `<|function_call|>` / `<|message_sep|>` are matched against `delta_text` only, so anything that re-chunks the stream and splits a marker leaks it into `delta.content`, and `ARGS_REGEX` lets the wrapper's closing brace and a partial `</s>` into the streamed arguments. Dupe-check and test results are in the description.

@chaunceyjiang @aarnphm

